  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-09-25T14:21:44-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, September 25, 2024, 2:21 pm\">September 25, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild’s Saturday, October 19, General Meeting will feature Paul Schulenberg who will demonstrate oil portrait painting following our short business meeting.  Business meeting will start at 1:30pm at the Harwich Community Center in the Multi-Purpose Room. The meeting and demonstration is free and open to the public. <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7104\" src=\"/media/archive/447b976d71377919c8ab14bfb2455cef5b1e7db07c90472d943769a88e8361d6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
